    "Top 3 improves HitRate and MTTC but reduces MRR by 0.031377 and TechnicalScore by 0.000663.",
    "Its fold TechnicalScore is split two wins and two losses, with material losses on folds 1 and 3.",
    "Top 5 reduces but does not remove the MRR regression and produces a larger TechnicalScore loss.",
    "The learned route adds about 69 ms mean rerank latency and a roughly 2.03 second observed cold-start maximum.",
    "Peak RSS is available only for the evaluator parent process; spawned CrossEncoder worker and total process-tree peak memory were not measured.",
